  "notes": "# What\u2019s new in OverCue Desktop 2.1.3 for macOS\n\n- Keeps Device Library playlists available when an additional OneLibrary export is empty, unreadable, or cannot be matched safely.\n- Allows stem preparation using Device Library alone, including when an unreadable OneLibrary file remains on the USB.\n- Fixes USB discovery so an inaccessible volume cannot hide other readable rekordbox USBs, including Mac OS Extended (Journaled) drives.\n",
